{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of a seemingly hopeless war among the stars, take control of highly customizable spacefighters to experience classic space combat action throughout a story-driven campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/29ae6163f4643b8e67131ea8e1b189fb.poster.avif?t=1765187984\" width=828 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/29ae6163f4643b8e67131ea8e1b189fb.webm?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/29ae6163f4643b8e67131ea8e1b189fb.mp4?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET IN THE COCKPIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SHROUDED SUNS  takes the <strong>immersion, atmosphere, and tension</strong> at the heart of retro classics of the space game genre and combines it with intuitive controls to give you an experience that is easy to pick up <strong>without letting physics get in the way of the action</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/72390deaa4973d5d2b93e7b05d231af9.poster.avif?t=1765187984\" width=828 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/72390deaa4973d5d2b93e7b05d231af9.webm?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/72390deaa4973d5d2b93e7b05d231af9.mp4?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET YOUR HANDS DIRTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your fighter and your squadron</strong> using a wide variety of components and weapons, and unlock additional components by completing bonus objectives during missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/0237a40fe5fd78fdf47c8645d72ec621.poster.avif?t=1765187984\" width=828 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/0237a40fe5fd78fdf47c8645d72ec621.webm?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/0237a40fe5fd78fdf47c8645d72ec621.mp4?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE COMMAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are ALPHA-1. The squadron takes your orders. Use the Quick-Command-System to <strong>assign orders to other pilots</strong> without pausing the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/bc584898826542e85001f137452b55fc.poster.avif?t=1765187984\" width=828 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/bc584898826542e85001f137452b55fc.webm?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060820/extras/bc584898826542e85001f137452b55fc.mp4?t=1765187984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060820?t=1765187984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb